Hi Matt,

I had a similar problem trying to fit a conditional multinomial N-mix too..
As Denis said, I think you may have a problem with initial values of N latent variable.
I would try to get the maximum count (ncap) you have for all sites in all years and sum 1 or 2 to define initial values for N.
Like,
inits<-function(){list(N=matrix(max(ncap)+2,nsites,nyears), ...

Hope it helps! =)

Ismael

